          "name": "User Story"
        },
        "title": "Pay with saved card",
        "description": "As a returning customer, I want to pay with a card I saved before, so I don't have to type the number again.\n\nCards live in the **vault service** as tokens; we never see the card number. Show the brand, the last four digits and the expiry from `GET /cards`.\n\n- Default to the card used last\n- Expired cards are shown but can't be picked\n- Fall back to the new-card form if the vault is down",
        "descriptionHtml": "<p>As a returning customer, I want to pay with a card I saved before, so I don't have to type the number again.</p>\n<p>Cards live in the <strong>vault service</strong> as tokens; we never see the card number. Show the brand, the last four digits and the expiry from <code>GET /cards</code>.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Default to the card used last</li>\n<li>Expired cards are shown but can't be picked</li>\n<li>Fall back to the new-card form if the vault is down</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "acceptanceCriteria": [
